AIMP v6.00.3077 Beta 4 (23.07.2026)
===================================
+ General: native Linux x86-64 support
+ General: compatibility with Windows 11 on ARM
+ General: app appearance has been updated
+ General: the %StrPart macro has been added
+ General: the %Tag(A) macro has been added to access to custom tag field of playing track
+ General: an ability to move items in list via Ctrl+Shift+Top/Bottom/Home/End hotkeys
+ Sound engine: resampler algorithm has been improved
+ Player: an ability to abort connecting operation to Internet radiostation
+ Player: mouse wheel on the icon in notification area now adjusts volume
+ Tag editor: an ability to disable escaping the meta due batch file renaming
+ Tag editor: rename files - usability has been improved
+ Skin Engine: an ability to specify individual scaling factor for a window
+ Music Library: add the "not contain" operator
+ Music Library: grouping tree - ability to define few fields on single level using composite field
+ Music library: an ability to disable grouping by Ctrl+Click on cell value
+ Music library: new view in the table - rows with thumbnails
+ Plugins: InputFFmpeg - support for E-AC3
+ Plugins: InputFFmpeg - support for HE-AAC
+ Plugins: InputFFmpeg - support for MLP (streaming mode only)
+ Plugins: InputFFmpeg - the FFmpeg libraries has been updated to v7.11
+ Plugins: SACD - support for DSD1024
- Fixed: music library - file modification date not updated after changing rating in file tags
- Fixed: issues from incoming crash-reports

